  "grammar_function": "A follow-up of A1 6.15 Mission: Meet at the Museum: A1 closes Unit 6 with a walk to the museum; A1+ 6.15 closes A1+ Unit 6 with Ana's arrival in a new city, with no new language. The learner finds travelers by late, early and on time and the one who buys a ticket (6.11-6.12), places from what people go there to do and from Is there \u2026 near here? (6.1, 6.3), what the park's signs forbid with You can't \u2026 here. (6.9), and each step of a hotel check-in (6.13), then answers aloud for Ana: One-way or round-trip? (6.11), Is the hotel far? (6.10), Do you have a reservation? (6.13) and Where is your passport? (6.5). Every scene is a mission-only photo.",
